Accuracy 0.8975562388736041
This accuracy value means that the model predicted the correct category (y or n) for 89.8 % of the values in the data set. I chose a threshold value of .45 because it slightly increased 
the accuracy value without significantly decreasing the metric values.

Precision 0.6067796610169491
This precision value means that of the clients in the model that were predicted to have subscribed, 60.7 % actually subscribed.

Recall 0.257183908045977
This recall value means that the model found 25.7% of all the clients that subscribed to a term deposit.

F1 0.3612512613521695
This value combines precision and recall. 

ROC_AUC 0.7986035992126133
This ROC_AUC value means that the model was fairly good at predicting positive examples above negative ones. This does not affirm that the model 
was a good predictor of subscribers.
